    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u13.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Zero conditional",
        "ru": "Нулевой тип условия"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "For general truths and facts use the zero conditional: If + present simple, present simple. \"If\" can also mean \"when\" for facts.",
        "ru": "Для общих истин и фактов — нулевой тип: If + present simple, present simple. Здесь \"if\" близко к \"when\"."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "if + present",
            "ru": "if + present"
          },
          "formula": "If + present simple, present simple",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "If you heat ice, it melts.",
              "ru": "Если нагреть лёд, он тает."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "conditionals-0-1"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "fact",
            "ru": "факт"
          },
          "formula": "general truth",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Plants die if they don't get water.",
              "ru": "Растения гибнут, если не получают воды."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "conditionals-0-1"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Both verbs are present simple — no \"will\" here: \"If it rains, the ground gets wet\".",
          "ru": "Оба глагола в present simple — без \"will\": \"If it rains, the ground gets wet\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "You can swap the halves: \"Ice melts if you heat it\".",
          "ru": "Части можно менять местами: \"Ice melts if you heat it\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u13.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "How nature works",
        "ru": "Как устроена природа"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u13.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "Nature follows simple rules. If the sun shines, the ice melts. If it rains a lot, the river gets bigger. Birds fly south if the weather gets cold.",
          "ru": "Природа живёт по простым правилам. Если светит солнце, лёд тает. Если много дождя, река становится больше. Птицы летят на юг, если холодает.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u13.d01.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u13.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "Animals need nature. If a forest disappears, the animals lose their home. If we protect nature, wild animals and plants live well. It is all connected.",
          "ru": "Животным нужна природа. Если лес исчезает, животные теряют дом. Если мы бережём природу, дикие животные и растения живут хорошо. Всё связано.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u13.d01.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
